{
  "title": "Snowball Edge · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "전용 장비를 현장으로 배송해 대량 데이터를 옮기는 방식입니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Snowball Edge</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/#guide-1\">물리 전송의 흐름</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/#guide-2\">전송 방식 선택하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>49 / 62</span></div><h1>Snowball Edge</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Snowball Edge는 <strong>AWS 장비를 현장에 배송받아 대량 데이터를 복사하고, 장비를 반송해 AWS로 옮기는 서비스</strong>입니다. 네트워크로 전송하기에 시간이 오래 걸리거나 연결 환경이 제한된 경우에 사용하는 물리 전송 방식입니다.</p><p>장비에서 지원되는 로컬 처리 기능을 이용할 수도 있습니다. 실제 도입은 이용 자격과 장비 제공 여부를 먼저 확인하며, 현재 신규 고객용 서비스로는 제공되지 않습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"storage-optimized\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"compute-optimized\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"import-jobs-and-export-jobs\"></span><h2>물리 전송의 흐름</h2><p>전송 작업을 준비하고 배송받은 장비에 데이터를 복사합니다. 데이터는 암호화해 저장하며, 장비와 잠금 해제 정보의 접근 권한을 관리합니다.</p><p>장비를 반송하면 AWS가 지정한 저장소로 데이터를 가져옵니다. 전송 결과를 확인하고 원본과 비교하는 검증 절차까지 포함합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"snowball-edge-client-and-aws-opshub\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"encryption-and-chain-of-custody\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"local-storage-and-offline-computing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"availability-and-alternatives\"></span><h2>전송 방식 선택하기</h2><p>필요한 전송 시간은 데이터 복사 속도뿐 아니라 장비 준비와 왕복 배송 시간에도 영향을 받습니다. 마감 일정, 현장 네트워크, 보안 요구를 함께 판단합니다.</p><p>새로운 전송 계획에서는 온라인 전송을 위한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync</a>, 물리 전송을 위한 AWS Data Transfer Terminal이나 파트너 솔루션 등 현재 이용할 수 있는 방식을 검토합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>장비를 통한 대량 데이터 이동</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>현장 복사</strong><span>배송된 장비에 데이터 저장</span></li><li><strong>안전한 반송</strong><span>암호화·운송 관리</span></li><li><strong>AWS로 가져오기</strong><span>지정 저장소에 적재</span></li><li><strong>결과 검증</strong><span>누락·완전성 확인</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">네트워크 전송 시간과 물리 배송 시간을 함께 비교하는 방식입니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>네트워크 대역폭이 매우 제한된 현장의 대규모 데이터를 옮겨야 합니다. 데이터량과 배송 일정을 계산하고, 이용 가능한 물리 전송 서비스와 온라인 전송을 비교합니다.</p></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/snowball/latest/developer-guide/whatisedge.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Snowball Edge? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/snowball/latest/developer-guide/whatissnowball.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AWS Snowball Edge Developer Guide ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/snowball/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AWS Snowball | Secure Edge Computing and Offline Data Transfer ↗</a></li></ol><a class=\"official\" href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/snowball/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AWS Snowball | Secure Edge Computing and Offline Data Transfer ↗</a></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q051/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q051\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q051\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q051</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q051/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An existing Snowball Edge customer must import hundreds of terabytes to S3, but the available network link is too slow. Which option uses physically shipped devices?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q051\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Snowball Edge Storage Optimized</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q051\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon ElastiCache</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q051\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q051\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A VPC endpoint</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · 기존 고객은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/#storage-optimized\">Storage Optimized</a> 장치를 배송받아 데이터를 복사하고 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>로 반송해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 가져올 수 있다. 신규 고객에게는 장치 주문이 제공되지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q101\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q101\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q101</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q101/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An existing Snowball Edge customer operates a remote factory with intermittent connectivity and must analyze video locally before transferring results to AWS. Which device configuration is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q101\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DataSync over a continuous network connection</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q101\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q101\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Snowball Edge Compute Optimized</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q101\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/#compute-optimized\">Compute Optimized</a>는 연결이 제한된 현장에서 로컬 컴퓨팅을 수행하고 이후 데이터를 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>로 옮기는 기존 고객의 용도에 맞는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q102\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q102\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q102</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q102/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which statement best distinguishes Snowball Edge from AWS DataSync for an existing customer?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q102\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Both services require a continuously available high-bandwidth internet link</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q102\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Snowball Edge can provide local compute and physically transport data, while DataSync moves data over a network</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q102\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">DataSync ships encrypted appliances, while Snowball Edge is a software agent</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q102\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Neither service can move data to Amazon S3</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a>는 물리 장치로 데이터 운송과 현장 컴퓨팅을 지원한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#aws-datasync\">DataSync</a>는 네트워크를 통한 온라인 전송 서비스다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q103\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q103\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q103</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q103/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">As of September 2026, a new AWS customer needs an offline physical-transfer solution for a large data migration. Which statement is accurate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q103\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The customer should order a new Snowball Edge device without restrictions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q103\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront provides physical device shipping</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q103\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 gateway endpoint is a physical-transfer device</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q103\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Snowball Edge is unavailable to new customers; evaluate AWS Data Transfer Terminal or partner solutions</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a>를 신규 고객에게 제공하지 않는다. 현재 물리 전송 대안으로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#aws-data-transfer-terminal\">AWS Data Transfer Terminal</a> 또는 파트너 솔루션을 안내한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q050\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q050\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q050</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q050/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company repeatedly transfers data from an on-premises NAS to EFS and S3 over the network and synchronizes changes. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q050\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q050\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Snow Family only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q050\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q050\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DataSync</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#aws-datasync\">DataSync</a>는 온라인 데이터 전송·동기화를 자동화한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">이전 용어 <b>Security Group</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">다음 용어 <b>SNS</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
